    "title": "GATEWAY-apiwizruntimedoc-List Telecom Sim Historys-v2-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM History Retrieval API allows users to access historical data related to telecom SIM cards. By leveraging this API, developers can retrieve detailed information about SIM usage, activation, deactivation, and any transactions associated with each SIM. This resource is particularly beneficial for telecom operators, customer support teams, and data analysts who need insights into SIM card performance over time. Use this API to enhance customer engagement and improve service offerings based on historical SIM data.",
